      <title>PortWin 1.31</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 18:41:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>32</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.31</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Programs in folders whose names contain characters Windows forbids now start instead of failing with exit code 53</li><li>Programs started through a linked folder now see that folder as their working directory</li><li>Games from a Steam library start Steam first and wait for sign-in, so mod loaders such as SKSE are no longer bypassed</li><li>Problem reports now show when Wine could not open the program file</li></ul>]]></description>
